# Help us get music and culture in early education and win a free 5 week course?

We have been providing Kindy's around South East QLD with our Drum Sing Dance Programs for a long time now and we are finally in the process of getting a video made for the workshops which is super exciting. We have numerous workshops booked over the next few months with local kindies and we are really hoping to get the word out even more. We are asking you guys who know us and have seen us in action to help us get the word out there! If you know of a local Kindy that you think would be interested in our Drum Sing Dance Program we would love you to share our contact. To say Thankyou!! we are offering a FREE 5 week course valued at $99 for any word of mouth recommendations that lead to a DRUM SING DANCE booking for 2016. If you are a Kindergarten and have recommended us to another organisation we are giving you 10% off your next booking! We value your support more than you can imagine and appreciate your help to get music and culture in early childhood education.
